    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esta gaguush sugoocheanda ea Hamani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedeaba samwagu gookwa Esta hang'weaka sugoocheanduumeeda, ak ghamiinaada aba seamooda gheeda sugoocheanda, deaschi sea gheeda sugoocheanda. Ak goopteada sugoocheanda aba uhuuda hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda deaschi gidaghuuta gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah sugoocheanda Esta was gatmooda sugoocheanda nea ghamiinaada aba seamooda, ak ghwanyas masooda aba madeadaanyi, ak ghamiin sugoocheanda Esta aba bileangida meeng'meeng'i mida geatindaanyi. Hean gawa Esta ama neekiisa ghwasat ghuuta bileangida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha gatmooda sugoocheanda, “Gigasayi naaha Esta? Gidibwariinyi naaha? Gajeegoonyi sugoocheanduumeedeanyu eara ealach bugusta nibiyeenya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Esta ak gwayeesha, “Iidaah sugoocheanda gideaba ghwahit, abeeda dahina askweareani sugoocheanda ea Hamani ghwaak hamiteaba askweari, aba gideaba neadiing'diing'di aba sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayi sugoocheanda, “Ayeani Hamani nea ghoalamwaji, gajeesinda gidagasiida Esta.” Hean gawa sugoocheanda ea Hamani ghwaak hamiteaba askweari sin Esta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda sileaha difaayi, ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha Esta, “Ang'iing'i gimusi naaha? Ak gajeegoonyi. Ak gigasayi naaha? Eara sugoocheanduumeedeanyu, iisilach bugusta gajeegoonyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Esta ak gwayeesha, “Gideamuschi ea gideagasayi nihi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas ghaanyaschi masooda aba madeeda sugoocheanda, ak ghwahit aba heeda sugoocheanda ak ghamwas gideamuschi nea gwasinnean gideagasayi, ak ghwahidu gicha sugoocheanda sea Hamani numuji ghwaak hamiteaba askweari jea dasin aba badaydeaba saawa, abeeda numuji gaydasinda gidanyaashta sugoocheanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hamani ghamwaal gichea gwanuusta Mordekai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak askweardida gwarita Hamani jarooda nea gaba hooseaneega ak gahoosan gurooroadaanyi. Hean nea ghwadaah Hamani Mordekai aba ghuuta dooshta sugoocheanda, ak ghwadaah mwamiinaada ak mabwadana aba madeadaanyi, ak ghwanyareas muuchi aba badayda Mordekai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoang'waay geaw Hamani, ak gawa gheanyi; ak goojeakta gaguursa fugaaschi duupchi ea gatmoadaanyi was Sereshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarukwiisa Hamani saawa giteena meanang'oocheanduumeadaanyi, ea mooneeda orjoagaaschi, ea ng'asheega sean sissa sugoocheanda niny, ak goodiing'da ghoah siida haw ambal fuga ambaliischi ea fuga gadiyeeda bea sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabalool Hamani nea gwayi, “Eara gatmooda sugoocheanda was Esta miigaguursa siinuut adeayi sugoocheanda aba hamita sin bea askweari geakghusan. Ak eara numuji ea siguurnean aniini ea sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak suh seaniin gaygwaloosean naaha, nea ghaadaayi Mordekai was siida Yahudi nea goopteada aba ghuuta dooshta sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda gatmoadaanyi was Sereshi ea fugaaschi sean duupchi ak geeyeesha niny, “Nung' eesin geeta geaw bea geatin haradam ea damanamughuush, ak numuji giibalooli sugoocheanda eeratiisa Mordekai uhuuda; ak guwi ayaaga hamitida bea askweariin sea sugoocheanda nea gihoosani.” Ak ng'asheanji goohoosan Hamani ak gawa gwasin geetida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
